# Pivot Dancewear

> DTC dancewear brand selling premium dance tops, bottoms, and accessories for dancers of all ages. Specialises in ballet, jazz, tap, contemporary, and recital wear.

Pivot Dancewear (pivotdancewear.com) offers premium kids' dancewear at accessible prices. Products are designed primarily for girls ages 4–12 using 4-way stretch fabric with a smooth matte finish. Comparable quality to boutique brands like Five the Label and Jo+Jax. Free shipping to US and Canada.

**Primary audience:** dancers, dance parents, dance teachers, and studio owners

